{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Survivors: Defense</strong> is a pixel-style survival defense game where you must stand your ground against endless waves of incoming monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and auto-attacking gameplay, the focus is on strategy and positioning. Every run offers a fresh experience thanks to random skills, items, and enemy patterns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and collect XP to level up! Each upgrade makes you stronger and unlocks devastating combos to dominate the battlefield.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills, Items, and Heroes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ playable characters</strong>, each with unique attack styles and passive abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ distinctive items</strong> \u2014 choose carefully to build your perfect setup every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ powerful skills</strong>, each offering different effects and playstyles.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878090?t=1768744281","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878090/a0acab1cf5359a3e1785835977651bc7c8f8e2f1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768744281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878090/4bebbeef84a1d2fcdd0ccbc00400f2c27a3e22b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768744281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878090/4bebbeef84a1d2fcdd0ccbc00400f2c27a3e22b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768744281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors